{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01JpxcteRb6UqcVWqaKrW4An","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VCpxDoQQUrkqpp371HRBke","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — SOS 1: The Dawning Archaic\n\n## Test file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py`\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTheDawningArchaicProperties`\n\n**Purpose**: Verify the card's static characteristics match the spec.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_is_creature` | Type line is \"Legendary Creature — Avatar\"; must be a `Creature` subclass |\n| `test_name` | Name must be \"The Dawning Archaic\" |\n| `test_mana_cost` | Mana cost is `{10}` (10 generic colorless) |\n| `test_power` | P/T 7/7 — base_power == 7 |\n| `test_toughness` | P/T 7/7 — base_toughness == 7 |\n| `test_has_reach` | Keywords includes `Keyword.REACH` |\n| `test_is_legendary` | Type line includes \"Legendary\" — `Supertype.LEGENDARY in supertypes` |\n| `test_creature_card_type` | `CardType.CREATURE in card_types` |\n| `test_avatar_subtype` | Subtype \"Avatar\" must be present |\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTheDawningArchaicCostReduction`\n\n**Purpose**: Verify the cost-reduction mechanic: \"costs {1} less for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.\"\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_no_graveyard_cards_no_reduction` | With empty graveyard, cost_reduction returns 0 |\n| `test_one_instant_in_graveyard_reduces_by_one` | One instant → reduce by 1 |\n| `test_one_sorcery_in_graveyard_reduces_by_one` | One sorcery → reduce by 1 |\n| `test_multiple_instants_and_sorceries_reduce_each` | 4 instants/sorceries → reduce by 4 |\n| `test_non_instant_sorcery_cards_do_not_contribute` | Creatures, lands, enchantments in GY → no reduction |\n| `test_mixed_graveyard_counts_only_instants_and_sorceries` | Only instant/sorcery cards contribute |\n| `test_ten_instants_reduces_full_cost` | 10 instants → full reduction of the 10-generic cost |\n| `test_more_than_ten_instants_capped_at_ten` | Reduction capped at the generic portion (engine's `get_cost_reduction` enforces this) |\n| `test_opponent_graveyard_does_not_contribute` | Only controller's own graveyard counts, not opponent's |\n| `test_cast_cost_reduced_by_graveyard` | Integration: with 9 instants in GY, can cast for 1 mana |\n\n**Edge cases considered**:\n- Capping: the spec says \"{1} less ... for each instant and sorcery card\" — with 10+ cards, the engine's `get_cost_reduction` clamps at the generic cost. Tested with > 10 cards.\n- Only the controller's graveyard matters (the word \"your\" in oracle text).\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTheDawningArchaicTriggerRegistration`\n\n**Purpose**: Verify that `register_triggers()` wires an `AttacksTriggeredEvent` trigger correctly.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_registers_at_least_one_trigger` | At least one trigger is registered |\n| `test_registers_attacks_trigger` | Registered trigger watches `AttacksTriggeredEvent` |\n| `test_trigger_source_is_card` | Trigger's `.source` is the card itself |\n| `test_trigger_condition_is_self_only` | Condition passes for `creature=self`, fails for other creatures |\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTheDawningArchaicAttackTriggerEffect`\n\n**Purpose**: Verify the attack trigger's effect — free-cast an instant or sorcery from the graveyard.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_attack_trigger_casts_instant_from_graveyard` | Firing the trigger removes an instant from the graveyard (it was cast) |\n| `test_attack_trigger_no_op_with_empty_graveyard` | Empty graveyard → trigger effect resolves without error |\n| `test_attack_trigger_fires_on_attacking` | Firing an AttacksTriggeredEvent for this card pushes a trigger onto the stack |\n| `test_other_creature_attack_does_not_fire_trigger` | AttacksTriggeredEvent for a different creature does not fire this trigger |\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTheDawningArchaicExileReplacement`\n\n**Purpose**: Verify the replacement effect: \"If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_free_cast_spell_goes_to_exile_not_graveyard` | After trigger fires + stack resolves, the spell is NOT in the graveyard |\n| `test_free_cast_spell_is_in_exile_after_resolution` | After trigger fires + stack resolves, the spell IS in exile |\n\n---\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n\n- **Targeting interaction with the attack trigger**: The oracle text says \"target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard\" — full targeting pipeline with `TargetRequirement` could be tested if the implementation uses it. This is partially covered by checking the card leaves the graveyard, but detailed target validation is marked as potentially untestable if the engine target system cannot be driven from tests without the full cast pipeline.\n- **Multiple instants/sorceries in graveyard — which one gets cast**: The trigger says \"target\" — choice is made by the player. Tests verify the effect happens without asserting which specific card is chosen (to avoid over-constraining the implementation).\n- **Protect against double-application of replacement**: Testing that the exile replacement fires exactly once is beyond current engine API surface.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4949,"cache_read_input_tokens":66007,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4949,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011XS3NnFVFPcGNqAtULLC3m","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"b2958595-005c-4986-8e16-20630ff6cfbd","request_id":"req_011CbTyQAhf5z4m1wYcHEvhH","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description"