{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01QURABSmh81exbEXVuzJpFC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CxhFGWKjCdzoFa8rqhPeWL","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/coordinator-directives.md","content":"# Coordinator Directives for sos_13\n\n## Untestable item 1: Swords to Plowshares copy effect\nThe Implementer should expose a clear `cast_prepared_spell(game, target_creature)` method (or equivalent) that:\n- Exiles the target creature from the battlefield\n- Grants its controller life equal to the creature's power\nThis API will allow the Tester to write tests for this requirement.\n\n## Untestable item 2: Inkling token dual-color\nThe engine (or the token creation) should expose a `colors` attribute on tokens so their color identity can be verified. The Implementer should set the Inkling token's colors to include both white and black.\n\n## Note on existing tests\n30 tests were written covering what could be tested before implementation. After the implementation exposes the above APIs, the Tester will be re-invoked to cover the two gaps.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":594,"cache_read_input_tokens":28941,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":594},"output_tokens":39,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"828fe639-76d3-4223-92fd-c987ba689b75","request_id":"req_011CbU13d8HeguiyH1tPnG83"}
