{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J6uojkZkQaSbRys5othBgG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives for sos_13\n2\t\n3\t## Untestable item 1: Swords to Plowshares copy effect\n4\tThe Implementer should expose a clear `cast_prepared_spell(game, target_creature)` method (or equivalent) that:\n5\t- Exiles the target creature from the battlefield\n6\t- Grants its controller life equal to the creature's power\n7\tThis API will allow the Tester to write tests for this requirement.\n8\t\n9\t## Untestable item 2: Inkling token dual-color\n10\tThe engine (or the token creation) should expose a `colors` attribute on tokens so their color identity can be verified. The Implementer should set the Inkling token's colors to include both white and black.\n11\t\n12\t## Note on existing tests\n13\t30 tests were written covering what could be tested before implementation. After the implementation exposes the above APIs, the Tester will be re-invoked to cover the two gaps.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LkcWR1HxHKpCqu5oUyMLGu","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"7b55a367-70ab-4d5f-97ea-3fef6c48d18d","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:14:50.188Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_13"}
