{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GcCnjKfcLU3HwC5rUmDge2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Rationale — SOS 13: Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n2\t\n3\t## File: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\n4\t\n5\t### Card Summary\n6\t\n7\tEmeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares is a double-faced card (DFC):\n8\t- Front face: 3/3 Cat Cleric creature, {1}{W}{W}\n9\t- Back face: Swords to Plowshares, a {W} Instant (the \"spell\" side)\n10\t\n11\tETB trigger (front face):\n12\t1. Target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying.\n13\t2. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared.\n14\t\n15\t\"Prepared\" mechanic: While the creature is prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell (Swords to Plowshares). Doing so unprepares it.\n16\t\n17\t---\n18\t\n19\t## Test Classes\n20\t\n21\t### `TestEmeritusOfTruceProperties` (8 tests)\n22\tValidates static card data against the spec:\n23\t- `test_is_creature` — class hierarchy: must be a `Creature` instance.\n24\t- `test_name` — \"Emeritus of Truce\" must appear in the card name.\n25\t- `test_mana_cost` — exactly {1}{W}{W}.\n26\t- `test_power` — base power 3.\n27\t- `test_toughness` — base toughness 3.\n28\t- `test_card_type_is_creature` — CREATURE in card_types.\n29\t- `test_cat_subtype` — \"Cat\" in subtypes.\n30\t- `test_cleric_subtype` — \"Cleric\" in subtypes.\n31\t\n32\t### `TestEmeritusOfTrucePreparedAttribute` (1 test)\n33\tValidates the Prepared mechanic's attribute existence and defaults:\n34\t- `test_is_prepared_defaults_to_false` — freshly constructed card has `is_prepared = False`.\n35\t\n36\t### `TestEmeritusETBTriggerRegistration` (4 tests)\n37\tValidates `register_triggers()` wires the ETB trigger correctly:\n38\t- `test_registers_at_least_one_trigger` — trigger count increases after registration.\n39\t- `test_registers_etb_trigger` — at least one trigger watches `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent`.\n40\t- `test_trigger_source_is_card` — `source` attribute of the trigger is the card instance.\n41\t- `test_trigger_condition_fires_only_for_self` — condition returns True for self, False for others.\n42\t\n43\t### `TestEmeritusETBTokenCreation` (6 tests)\n44\tValidates the \"create a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying\" effect:\n45\t- `test_etb_creates_exactly_one_token` — exactly one token per ETB.\n46\t- `test_inkling_token_has_flying` — token has `Keyword.FLYING`.\n47\t- `test_inkling_token_is_1_1` — token's base_power == 1, base_toughness == 1.\n48\t- `test_inkling_token_is_marked_as_token` — `is_token == True`.\n49\t- `test_inkling_token_on_target_player_battlefield` — when opponent is targeted, token goes to opponent's battlefield.\n50\t- `test_inkling_token_has_inkling_subtype` — \"Inkling\" in token's subtypes.\n51\t\n52\t### `TestEmeritusOfTrucePreparedCondition` (4 tests)\n53\tValidates the conditional \"becomes prepared\" logic:\n54\t- `test_becomes_prepared_when_opponent_has_more_creatures` — sets `is_prepared = True` when opponent has more.\n55\t- `test_not_prepared_when_creature_counts_equal` — stays False when counts equal.\n56\t- `test_not_prepared_when_you_have_more_creatures` — stays False when you're ahead.\n57\t- `test_not_prepared_when_opponent_has_zero_creatures` — stays False when opponent has zero.\n58\t\n59\t### `TestEmeritusOfTruceCastSpellWhenPrepared` (4 tests)\n60\tValidates the Prepared mechanic's casting and unpreparation:\n61\t- `test_cast_prepared_spell_unprepares_card` — calling `cast_prepared_spell()` sets `is_prepared = False`.\n62\t- `test_cast_prepared_spell_noop_when_not_prepared` — calling while not prepared does not raise.\n63\t- `test_prepared_spell_accesses_spell_side` — card exposes `spell_side` attribute.\n64\t- `test_prepared_spell_name_is_swords_to_plowshares` — spell side is named \"Swords to Plowshares\".\n65\t\n66\t### `TestEmeritusOfTruceTargeting` (3 tests)\n67\tValidates `get_targets()` and graceful no-op:\n68\t- `test_get_targets_returns_list` — returns a list.\n69\t- `test_get_targets_returns_at_least_one_requirement` — at least one requirement (for the player target).\n70\t- `test_no_chosen_targets_does_not_raise` — `on_resolve` without `chosen_targets` must not raise.\n71\t\n72\t---\n73\t\n74\t## Edge Cases Covered\n75\t\n76\t- Token lands on the **opponent's** battlefield when the opponent is targeted (not just the controller's).\n77\t- The \"prepared\" condition is a strict \"more than\" — equal creature counts do NOT trigger it.\n78\t- `is_prepared` starts as `False` (not prepared on ETB unless condition is met).\n79\t- `cast_prepared_spell()` is a no-op when called while not prepared.\n80\t\n81\t## Edge Cases NOT Covered (and why)\n82\t\n83\t- **Swords to Plowshares full resolution effects** (exile creature, gain life equal to its power): The STP spell side's full implementation is a separate functional concern that depends on the exile zone API and counter-management. These interactions are tested implicitly through the `cast_prepared_spell_unprepares_card` test; deeper STP effects are deferred to untestable (see below) or the implementer's on_resolve logic. The core contract here is the token creation and prepared mechanic.\n84\t- **Multiple ETB firings in a single turn**: Not tested because it's outside the scope of a per-card unit test.\n85\t- **Interaction with replacement effects (e.g. token-doubling)**: Engine-level; out of scope for this card.\n86\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Szf1o2Ha8JSCfYUHvHLQDr","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"6d2dfa0b-ac31-43c2-a27b-c94347381e4e","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:17:55.865Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester re-invoke for sos_13 untestable items"}
