{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"aa71a3f55487215e1","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Szf1o2Ha8JSCfYUHvHLQDr","description":"Editing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":28562,"tool_uses":16,"duration_ms":71722},"last_tool_name":"Edit","uuid":"437f90fb-ba55-49ee-9ade-88994444f243","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01EQqVetJW4Y9SDvwTBZv5be","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XtjWPZ6AeXvzvMLBSsqkG2","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md","old_string":"## Edge Cases NOT Covered (and why)\n\n- **Swords to Plowshares full resolution effects** (exile creature, gain life equal to its power): The STP spell side's full implementation is a separate functional concern that depends on the exile zone API and counter-management. These interactions are tested implicitly through the `cast_prepared_spell_unprepares_card` test; deeper STP effects are deferred to untestable (see below) or the implementer's on_resolve logic. The core contract here is the token creation and prepared mechanic.\n- **Multiple ETB firings in a single turn**: Not tested because it's outside the scope of a per-card unit test.\n- **Interaction with replacement effects (e.g. token-doubling)**: Engine-level; out of scope for this card.","new_string":"### `TestSwordsToPlowsharesEffect` (4 tests) — NEW\nValidates the full Swords to Plowshares resolution via `cast_prepared_spell()`:\n- `test_cast_prepared_spell_exiles_target_creature` — the first available battlefield creature is removed from the battlefield and appears in its owner's exile zone.\n- `test_cast_prepared_spell_grants_life_equal_to_power` — the exiled creature's controller gains life equal to the creature's power (tested with power 5).\n- `test_cast_prepared_spell_grants_life_equal_to_power_opponent_creature` — life gain goes to the creature's controller even when that is the opponent (not the card's controller).\n- `test_cast_prepared_spell_zero_power_creature_no_life_gain` — a 0-power creature results in no life gain at all.\n\n### `TestInklingTokenColors` (3 tests) — NEW\nValidates the token's `colors` attribute to confirm it is both white and black:\n- `test_inkling_token_is_white` — `'W'` in `token.colors`.\n- `test_inkling_token_is_black` — `'B'` in `token.colors`.\n- `test_inkling_token_is_exactly_white_and_black` — `token.colors == {'W', 'B'}`, ensuring no extra colors are present.\n\n---\n\n## Edge Cases Covered (additions)\n\n- Exile is verified by checking both that the creature left the battlefield AND that it appears in `game.get_exile(player).get_all()`.\n- Life gain is verified for the creature's controller specifically — tested both for same-controller and cross-player scenarios.\n- Zero-power edge case: gain of 0 life is a no-op; verified that starting life is unchanged.\n- Token color test uses both individual-color assertions and an exact-set assertion to catch partial or spurious color additions.\n\n## Edge Cases NOT Covered (and why)\n\n- **Multiple ETB firings in a single turn**: Not tested because it's outside the scope of a per-card unit test.\n- **Interaction with replacement effects (e.g. token-doubling)**: Engine-level; out of scope for this card."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2054,"cache_read_input_tokens":26060,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2054,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Szf1o2Ha8JSCfYUHvHLQDr","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"afb485fc-dcb2-4ba0-9756-b7883b130c8f","request_id":"req_011CbU1PVmpwXgV9Ee5gYcoB","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester re-invoke for sos_13 untestable items"}
