{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017vfm5ULW6gRtXBh4GD2mEn","type":"tool_result","content":"self = <cards.sos.sos_57.tests.TestManaSculptWizardBonusMana object at 0x702507d57c10>\n\n    def test_wizard_present_trigger_fires_at_main_phase(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"The registered trigger fires at beginning of next main phase and adds mana.\"\"\"\n>       from engine.events import BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent  # Added by implementer\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nE       ImportError: cannot import name 'BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent' from 'engine.events' (/workspace/engine/events.py)\n\ncards/sos/sos_57/tests.py:367: ImportError\n=============================== warnings summary ===============================\n../usr/local/lib/python3.11/dist-packages/_pytest/config/__init__.py:1434\n  /usr/local/lib/python3.11/dist-packages/_pytest/config/__init__.py:1434: PytestConfigWarning: Unknown config option: timeout\n  \n    self._warn_or_fail_if_strict(f\"Unknown config option: {key}\\n\")\n\n-- Docs: https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/capture-warnings.html\n=========================== short test summary info ============================\nFAILED cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py::TestManaSculptWizardBonusMana::test_wizard_present_trigger_fires_at_main_phase\n========================= 1 failed, 1 warning in 0.03s =========================","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BbDN9Vux561uQvk4PqzpZC","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"ad6e8bcb-52bf-4002-9cc6-3346de5da698","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:27:01.780Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_57"}
{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"aa5acb20948f4ddd0","tool_use_id":"toolu_01BbDN9Vux561uQvk4PqzpZC","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":99247,"tool_uses":63,"duration_ms":255515},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"af83cebf-209a-48a1-9edf-bb4c8e82bb88","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Xn94DCW68j7W2os1q3zKvD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SyrLfctDBLTRdQkfZe4iLH","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for sos_57 — Mana Sculpt\n\n## Card Summary\n\nMana Sculpt is a `{1}{U}{U}` Instant that:\n1. Counters target spell (removes it from the stack, moves card to owner's graveyard).\n2. If the caster controls a Wizard, adds `{C}` equal to the countered spell's mana value at the beginning of the caster's next main phase.\n\n---\n\n## Test File: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`\n\n### Class: `TestManaSculptProperties`\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|------|----------------------|\n| `test_is_instant` | Card is an `Instant` subclass per `type_line`. |\n| `test_name` | Card name matches spec: `\"Mana Sculpt\"`. |\n| `test_mana_cost` | Mana cost matches `{1}{U}{U}`. |\n| `test_card_type_is_instant` | `CardType.INSTANT` is in `card_types`. |\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestManaSculptTargeting`\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|------|----------------------|\n| `test_get_targets_returns_list` | `get_targets` returns a list. |\n| `test_get_targets_returns_one_requirement` | Exactly one target requirement (single target spell). |\n| `test_get_targets_requirement_is_target_requirement` | The requirement is a `TargetRequirement` instance. |\n| `test_target_zone_is_stack` | Target must be on the stack (`Zone.STACK`). |\n| `test_target_filter_accepts_spell_stack_object` | Filter accepts a `StackObject` whose source is a spell. |\n| `test_target_filter_rejects_self` | Filter rejects the ManaSculpt itself (no self-targeting). |\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestManaSculptCountersSpell`\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|------|----------------------|\n| `test_on_resolve_removes_target_from_stack` | Resolving ManaSculpt removes the target from the stack (counter effect). |\n| `test_on_resolve_moves_countered_spell_to_graveyard` | The countered spell moves to its owner's graveyard. |\n| `test_on_resolve_no_target_is_noop` | Empty `chosen_targets` → no exception raised. |\n| `test_on_resolve_without_chosen_targets_attribute_is_noop` | Missing `chosen_targets` attribute → no exception raised. |\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestManaSculptNoWizardNoBonusMana`\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|------|----------------------|\n| `test_no_wizard_no_pending_mana` | Without a Wizard, no mana is immediately added to the pool. |\n| `test_no_wizard_no_trigger_registered` | Without a Wizard, no trigger is registered for the main-phase mana effect. |\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestManaSculptWizardBonusMana`\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|------|----------------------|\n| `test_wizard_triggers_mana_registration` | With a Wizard on the battlefield, a trigger is registered. |\n| `test_mana_amount_equals_countered_spell_cmc` | The pending mana amount (`pending_mana_amount`) equals the countered spell's CMC. |\n| `test_mana_amount_equals_zero_for_free_spell` | For a zero-cost countered spell, the bonus is 0. |\n| `test_wizard_check_uses_controller_battlefield` | Only the caster's battlefield is searched for Wizards, not the opponent's. |\n| `test_non_wizard_creature_does_not_trigger_bonus` | A non-Wizard creature on the battlefield does not trigger the bonus. |\n| `test_wizard_present_trigger_fires_at_main_phase` | The registered trigger fires on `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` and adds `{C}` equal to spell CMC. Requires `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` in `engine.events`. |\n| `test_trigger_is_one_shot` | The main-phase trigger fires only once (one-shot behavior). |\n\n---\n\n## Edge Cases Covered\n\n- **No target / missing chosen_targets**: on_resolve must be a no-op to avoid errors when the target has already left the stack.\n- **Opponent's Wizard doesn't count**: only the caster's battlefield is scanned for Wizards.\n- **Zero-CMC spell**: the mana amount of 0 is a valid edge case for the bonus.\n- **One-shot trigger**: the trigger should unregister itself after firing to prevent repeated mana generation.\n\n## Edge Cases Not Covered (and Why)\n\n- **The countered spell being an artifact / creature**: the counter effect is the same regardless of the countered card type; no separate test is needed.\n- **Multiple Wizards on the battlefield**: the condition is binary (any Wizard → bonus), so one Wizard is sufficient to verify the condition.\n- **Opponent casting Mana Sculpt**: the Wizard check uses the card's `controller`, so the same tests cover this by setting `controller=p1` explicitly.\n- **Interaction with other replacement effects**: out of scope for this card's contract.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":625,"cache_read_input_tokens":96588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":625,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BbDN9Vux561uQvk4PqzpZC","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"49520102-90ba-40f4-9337-54a17a8ce56f","request_id":"req_011CbU22JyDuAUoT4QrZ1oJQ","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_57"}
