{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ScmAhxoXzCrqCYAeEU7WMk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives for sos_57\n2\t\n3\t## Untestable item: BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent missing from engine\n4\t\n5\tThe Tester has written tests that rely on `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` from `engine.events`.\n6\tThe Implementer MUST add this event to the engine:\n7\t\n8\t1. Add `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` to `engine/events.py` with a `player` attribute.\n9\t2. In `engine/turn.py` (or the phase-progression code), fire this event at the start of PRECOMBAT_MAIN phase:\n10\t   `trigger_manager.fire_event(game, BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=game.active_player))`\n11\t3. This allows Mana Sculpt to schedule a one-shot trigger that adds colorless mana at the next main phase.\n12\t\n13\tAfter this engine addition, all 23 tests should pass.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CBr3rFfMgJhEkfiQQT64Ak","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"0a35913f-af94-457e-823f-e16e75c6e788","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:28:12.827Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_57"}
