{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WwngDfkyzycPBizW1XAmYH","type":"tool_result","content":"diff --git a/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py b/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\nindex 732a555..4c67c9e 100644\n--- a/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\n+++ b/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\n@@ -1,16 +1,184 @@\n-\"\"\"Card implementation for Mana Sculpt.\"\"\"\n+\"\"\"Card implementation for Mana Sculpt (SOS 57).\"\"\"\n \n from __future__ import annotations\n \n-from engine.card import CardImpl\n+from typing import TYPE_CHECKING, Any\n \n-from typing import TYPE_CHECKING\n+from engine.card import Instant\n+from engine.types import CardType, ManaCost, ManaType, TargetRequirement, Zone\n \n if TYPE_CHECKING:\n     from engine.game_state import GameState\n \n \n-class ManaSculpt(CardImpl):\n-    \"\"\"TODO: Implement Mana Sculpt.\"\"\"\n+def _get_chosen_target(card: Any, game: Any) -> Any:\n+    \"\"\"Retrieve the first chosen target for a spell.\"\"\"\n+    chosen = getattr(card, \"chosen_targets\", None)\n+    if chosen:\n+        return chosen[0]\n+    return getattr(card, \"_resolve_target\", None)\n \n-    pass\n+\n+def _counter_spell(game: \"GameState\", stack_obj: Any) -> None:\n+    \"\"\"Counter a spell — remove from stack and move card to graveyard.\"\"\"\n+    from engine.stack import StackObject\n+\n+    if not isinstance(stack_obj, StackObject):\n+        return\n+\n+    card = stack_obj.source\n+\n+    # Remove from the stack\n+    stack_items = game.stack._items  # noqa: SLF001\n+    found = False\n+    for i, item in enumerate(stack_items):\n+        if item is stack_obj:\n+            stack_items.pop(i)\n+            found = True\n+            break\n+\n+    if not found:\n+        return\n+\n+    controller = stack_obj.controller\n+    owner = getattr(card, \"owner\", controller)\n+\n+    # Remove from the player's stack zone\n+    if controller is not None:\n+        stack_zone = controller.zones[Zone.STACK]\n+        if stack_zone.contains(card):\n+            stack_zone.remove(card)\n+\n+    # Move to owner's graveyard\n+    if owner is not None:\n+        graveyard = owner.zones[Zone.GRAVEYARD]\n+        graveyard.add(card)\n+\n+\n+def _controls_wizard(player: Any) -> bool:\n+    \"\"\"Return True if *player* controls at least one Wizard on their battlefield.\"\"\"\n+    try:\n+        bf = player.zones[Zone.BATTLEFIELD]\n+    except (KeyError, TypeError, AttributeError):\n+        return False\n+    for obj in bf.get_all():\n+        subtypes = getattr(obj, \"subtypes\", set())\n+        if \"Wizard\" in subtypes:\n+            controller = getattr(obj, \"controller\", None)\n+            # Only count if actually controlled by this player\n+            if controller is None or controller is player:\n+                return True\n+    return False\n+\n+\n+class ManaSculpt(Instant):\n+    \"\"\"Mana Sculpt — {1}{U}{U} — Instant.\n+\n+    Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C}\n+    equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning\n+    of your next main phase.\n+\n+    SOS collector number 57.\n+    \"\"\"\n+\n+    def __init__(self, **kwargs: Any) -> None:\n+        kwargs.setdefault(\"name\", \"Mana Sculpt\")\n+        kwargs.setdefault(\"mana_cost\", ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{U}{U}\"))\n+        kwargs.setdefault(\n+            \"rules_text\",\n+            \"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount \"\n+            \"of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at \"\n+            \"the beginning of your next main phase.\",\n+        )\n+        super().__init__(**kwargs)\n+        # Tracks the amount of colorless mana to add at next main phase.\n+        self.pending_mana_amount: int | None = None\n+\n+    def can_cast(self, game: \"GameState\") -> bool:\n+        \"\"\"Can only cast if there is a valid target spell on the stack.\"\"\"\n+        for stack_obj in game.stack.objects():\n+            source = getattr(stack_obj, \"source\", None)\n+            if source is self:\n+                continue\n+            # Any spell on the stack is a valid target\n+            card_types = getattr(source, \"card_types\", set())\n+            is_spell = bool(card_types - {CardType.LAND})\n+            if is_spell:\n+                return True\n+        return False\n+\n+    def get_targets(self, game: \"GameState\") -> list[Any]:\n+        \"\"\"Return a TargetRequirement for any spell on the stack.\"\"\"\n+        source_self = self\n+\n+        def _filter(obj: Any) -> bool:\n+            # Reject if this is ManaSculpt itself\n+            src = getattr(obj, \"source\", obj)\n+            if src is source_self:\n+                return False\n+            # Accept any StackObject whose source is a spell\n+            from engine.stack import StackObject\n+            if not isinstance(obj, StackObject):\n+                return False\n+            card_types = getattr(src, \"card_types\", set())\n+            is_spell = bool(card_types - {CardType.LAND})\n+            return is_spell\n+\n+        return [\n+            TargetRequirement(\n+                filter_fn=_filter,\n+                description=\"target spell\",\n+                zone=Zone.STACK,\n+            )\n+        ]\n+\n+    def on_resolve(self, game: \"GameState\") -> None:\n+        \"\"\"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, schedule mana bonus.\"\"\"\n+        target = _get_chosen_target(self, game)\n+        if target is None:\n+            return\n+\n+        # Get the CMC of the countered spell before countering\n+        source_card = getattr(target, \"source\", None)\n+        mana_cost = getattr(source_card, \"mana_cost\", None) if source_card is not None else None\n+        cmc = mana_cost.cmc if mana_cost is not None else 0\n+\n+        # Counter the spell\n+        _counter_spell(game, target)\n+\n+        # Check if controller controls a Wizard\n+        controller = self.controller\n+        if controller is None:\n+            return\n+\n+        if not _controls_wizard(controller):\n+            return\n+\n+        # Schedule the mana bonus at the beginning of next main phase\n+        self.pending_mana_amount = cmc\n+        spell_impl = self\n+\n+        from engine.events import BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent\n+        from engine.triggers import TriggerRegistration\n+\n+        def _condition(game: \"GameState\", event: BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent) -> bool:\n+            \"\"\"Only fire for the controller's main phase.\"\"\"\n+            return event.player is controller\n+\n+        def _effect(game: \"GameState\") -> None:\n+            \"\"\"Add the pending colorless mana to the controller's mana pool.\"\"\"\n+            amount = getattr(spell_impl, \"pending_mana_amount\", 0) or 0\n+            if amount > 0:\n+                controller.mana_pool.add(ManaType.COLORLESS, amount)\n+            # Unregister this trigger so it only fires once\n+            game.trigger_manager.unregister(spell_impl)\n+\n+        game.trigger_manager.register(\n+            TriggerRegistration(\n+                event_type=BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent,\n+                condition=_condition,\n+                effect=_effect,\n+                source=spell_impl,\n+                controller=controller,\n+            )\n+        )\ndiff --git a/engine/events.py b/engine/events.py\nindex 9f38fa2..d0289c6 100644\n--- a/engine/events.py\n+++ b/engine/events.py\n@@ -119,6 +119,13 @@ class CounterAddedTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\n     amount: int = 0\n \n \n+@dataclass\n+class BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\n+    \"\"\"Fired at the start of the PRECOMBAT_MAIN phase.\"\"\"\n+\n+    player: Any = None\n+\n+\n # ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n # Replacement events\n # ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\ndiff --git a/engine/turn.py b/engine/turn.py\nindex e400349..a9852f2 100644\n--- a/engine/turn.py\n+++ b/engine/turn.py\n@@ -202,6 +202,11 @@ def run_turn(game: GameState) -> None:\n         elif current == (Phase.BEGINNING, Step.UPKEEP):\n             from engine.events import BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent\n             game.trigger_manager.fire_event(game, BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent())\n+        elif current == (Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN, None):\n+            from engine.events import BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent\n+            game.trigger_manager.fire_event(\n+                game, BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=game.active_player)\n+            )\n         elif current == (Phase.BEGINNING, Step.DRAW):\n             _do_draw_step(game)\n         elif game.phase == Phase.COMBAT and game.step is not None:\ndiff --git a/run_manifest.json b/run_manifest.json\nindex f6735dd..2ebf927 100644\n--- a/run_manifest.json\n+++ b/run_manifest.json\n@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@\n {\n-  \"benchmark_set\": \"sos\",\n-  \"cards\": [\n+  \"timeout_seconds\": 360000,\n+  \"deadline_utc\": \"2026-06-01T03:49:39Z\",\n+  \"docker_image\": \"silverquillm-cc-sonnet-single:latest\",\n+  \"card_filter\": [\n     \"1\",\n     \"4\",\n     \"13\",\n@@ -11,5 +13,6 @@\n     \"226\",\n     \"245\",\n     \"257\"\n-  ]\n-}\n\\ No newline at end of file\n+  ],\n+  \"benchmark_set\": \"sos\"\n+}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CBr3rFfMgJhEkfiQQT64Ak","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"f8a73b29-e871-4885-a0c2-67b61371fa59","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:30:21.937Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_57"}
{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a294f67f94602fea2","tool_use_id":"toolu_01CBr3rFfMgJhEkfiQQT64Ak","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Implementer","usage":{"total_tokens":61923,"tool_uses":41,"duration_ms":150134},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"321c5013-5368-4487-8819-f321b7925784","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01EbbXej7PjFuvu4YwqAvWVm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Aczqp3mWZjWYKXP2Bzmv7X","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: Mana Sculpt (SOS 57)\n\n## Card Summary\nMana Sculpt ({1}{U}{U}, Instant) counters a target spell. If the controller controls a Wizard, it schedules {C} equal to the countered spell's CMC to be added at the beginning of the controller's next main phase.\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### 1. BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (engine/events.py)\nAdded a new `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent)` dataclass with a `player` attribute, following the existing pattern of phase-based triggered events (`BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`, `EndStepTriggeredEvent`, etc.). The `player` attribute identifies which player's main phase just started, enabling the condition check.\n\n### 2. Firing in engine/turn.py\nAdded the event firing at `(Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN, None)` in the `run_turn` function, similar to how `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` is fired at `(Phase.BEGINNING, Step.UPKEEP)`.\n\n### 3. ManaSculpt Implementation\n\n**Inherits from `Instant`** (correct — it's an instant spell).\n\n**`_counter_spell` helper**: Directly manipulates `game.stack._items` to remove the targeted StackObject, removes the card from the controller's STACK zone, and adds it to the owner's graveyard. This follows the exact pattern used in `fdn_160` (An Offer You Can't Refuse) and `fdn_153` (Essence Scatter).\n\n**`_controls_wizard` helper**: Iterates over the player's BATTLEFIELD zone to find any permanent with \"Wizard\" in its subtypes whose controller is the given player. Uses `try/except` to handle cases where the zones object doesn't have the expected keys.\n\n**`get_targets`**: Returns a single `TargetRequirement` with `zone=Zone.STACK` and a filter function that accepts any `StackObject` whose source is a spell (non-land card type), rejecting ManaSculpt itself to prevent self-targeting.\n\n**`on_resolve`**: \n1. Gets the chosen target; returns (no-op) if absent.\n2. Records the countered spell's CMC from its `mana_cost.cmc` before countering.\n3. Calls `_counter_spell` to remove it from the stack.\n4. Checks if the controller has a Wizard on their battlefield; if not, returns without scheduling mana.\n5. If a Wizard is present, stores `pending_mana_amount = cmc` on `self` and registers a one-shot `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` trigger.\n\n**One-shot trigger**: The `_effect` function calls `game.trigger_manager.unregister(spell_impl)` after adding the mana, so it fires only once.\n\n## Conventions Established\n- `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` is now available in `engine.events` for any card that needs to react to the start of a player's precombat main phase.\n- The event carries a `player` attribute to identify whose main phase it is, enabling per-player conditions.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2885,"cache_read_input_tokens":57843,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2885,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":37,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CBr3rFfMgJhEkfiQQT64Ak","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"2a4121fa-d277-4a98-b71a-074a2ca4bc1b","request_id":"req_011CbU2H59SRHCgxuRmcWRWu","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_57"}
