{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J645Qsm1HbNt1NuVRNp8SD","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/types.py:164:    def cmc(self) -> int:\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:11:| `types.py` | 250+ | **Foundation** — All enums (`Color`, `ManaType`, `Zone`, `Phase`, `Step`, `CardType`, `Supertype`, `Keyword`) and core dataclasses (`ManaCost` with `.parse()` and `.cmc`, `HybridManaSymbol`, `TargetRequirement` with lazy `filter_fn` convention). `ManaCost.parse()` handles `{X/Y}` hybrid mana tokens. Zero internal dependencies. |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HHrusMb65YDLKTUU3AyBr2","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"aaddf9e1-f848-4b65-94bb-2aa4eec20982","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:31:38.213Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Reviewer for sos_57"}
