{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01RgqhWzrMLngds5HaWPpDG2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016DFbLqPS3Wuwb3i8iznoWU","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for sos_97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\n\n## Test file: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py\n\n---\n\n### TestRalZarekProperties (8 tests)\n\nVerify static card metadata matches the card spec:\n- `test_is_planeswalker`: Must be an instance of `Planeswalker`.\n- `test_name`: Name must be \"Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\".\n- `test_mana_cost`: `{1}{B}{B}` as declared in spec.\n- `test_planeswalker_card_type`: `CardType.PLANESWALKER` in card_types.\n- `test_legendary_supertype`: `Supertype.LEGENDARY` in supertypes (Legendary Planeswalker).\n- `test_ral_subtype`: \"Ral\" in subtypes (Planeswalker type).\n- `test_starting_loyalty_three`: `starting_loyalty == 3` as declared.\n- `test_initial_loyalty_equals_starting_loyalty`: `loyalty` initializes to `starting_loyalty`.\n\n---\n\n### TestRalZarekLoyaltyAbilities (6 tests)\n\nVerify the four loyalty abilities are declared with correct costs:\n- `test_returns_list_of_three`: Base test that `get_loyalty_abilities()` returns a non-empty list of 3 abilities (matching −1, +1, −2 in the expected positions).\n- `test_each_is_loyalty_ability`: Each element is a `LoyaltyAbility` instance.\n- `test_plus_one_ability_cost`: First ability has loyalty cost +1 (Surveil 2).\n- `test_minus_one_ability_cost`: Second ability has loyalty cost −1 (discard).\n- `test_minus_two_ability_cost`: Third ability has loyalty cost −2 (graveyard return).\n- `test_fourth_ability_cost_minus_seven`: The −7 ultimate must appear somewhere in the list.\n\nNote: The spec shows 4 abilities (+1, −1, −2, −7). The first 3 tests cover the expected ordered positions; the ultimate test searches by cost since it may be a 4th element.\n\n---\n\n### TestRalZarekSurveil (4 tests)\n\nValidate the +1 Surveil 2 behavior:\n- `test_surveil_moves_chosen_card_to_graveyard`: Cards the controller selects (\"yes\") move to graveyard; cards kept (\"no\") stay in the library. Uses the same pattern as FDN 32 (CephalidInkmage) which implements the same surveil mechanism.\n- `test_surveil_card_kept_stays_in_library`: A card selected to keep remains in the library.\n- `test_surveil_with_empty_library_does_not_raise`: If the library is empty, surveil is a no-op.\n- `test_surveil_only_looks_at_up_to_two_cards`: With 5 cards in library, exactly 2 are surveiled (sent to graveyard), not more.\n\nEdge cases covered: empty library, full library (only top 2 affected), partial selection (some to GY, some kept).\n\n---\n\n### TestRalZarekDiscard (4 tests)\n\nValidate the −1 \"any number of target players each discard a card\":\n- `test_targeted_player_discards_a_card`: Controller targeting themselves causes discard.\n- `test_opponent_discards_a_card`: Targeting opponent causes opponent's discard.\n- `test_no_targets_is_a_noop`: Zero targets → no discard, no error.\n- `test_multiple_players_each_discard`: Both players targeted → each discards.\n\nThe card says \"any number of target players\" which includes 0 (the no-target case).\n\n---\n\n### TestRalZarekGraveyardReturn (3 tests)\n\nValidate the −2 \"return target creature card with MV <= 3 from your graveyard to battlefield\":\n- `test_creature_with_mv_three_or_less_returns_to_battlefield`: A CMC-3 creature in graveyard enters battlefield.\n- `test_creature_moved_out_of_graveyard`: After return, creature is no longer in graveyard.\n- `test_no_target_is_a_noop`: Without a target set, no error and no state change.\n\nEdge cases NOT covered: mana value > 3 rejection (would need the implementation to expose a target-filter API; not present at test time). This is logged in untestable.json.\n\n---\n\n### TestRalZarekUltimate (4 tests)\n\nValidate the −7 \"flip five coins; target opponent skips next X turns (X = heads)\":\n- `test_ultimate_exists_with_minus_seven_cost`: −7 ability is declared in the list.\n- `test_ultimate_with_all_heads_skips_five_turns`: 5 heads → opponent skips 5 turns. Accepts either `game.extra_turns` growing or `p2.skipped_turns` attribute.\n- `test_ultimate_with_all_tails_skips_zero_turns`: 0 heads → 0 turns skipped.\n- `test_ultimate_no_target_does_not_raise`: No target → no crash.\n\nThe implementation is expected to accept `_coin_flip_results` as an injectable override for testing determinism. If the implementation uses its own internal randomness, coin-flip result injection may not be wired in — this is partially flagged in untestable.json.\n\n---\n\n### TestRalZarekLoyaltyTracking (3 tests)\n\nVerify the loyalty cost amounts declared on the abilities:\n- `test_plus_one_increases_loyalty`: `loyalty_cost == +1` so loyalty increases by 1.\n- `test_minus_one_decreases_loyalty`: `loyalty_cost == -1` so loyalty decreases by 1.\n- `test_minus_two_decreases_loyalty`: `loyalty_cost == -2` so loyalty decreases by 2.\n\nThese tests directly apply `ral.loyalty += ability.loyalty_cost` to verify the declared cost is correct. The game engine's dispatch layer uses `loyalty_cost` to adjust loyalty when an ability activates.\n\n---\n\n## Edge cases deliberately NOT covered\n\n- **Mana value > 3 rejection for −2**: The `get_targets` filter on the −2 ability would need to be exposed and tested separately. Without a `get_loyalty_targets` API, we cannot assert that a CMC-4 creature is rejected at the targeting stage. Logged in untestable.json.\n- **Coin flip randomness**: The ultimate's randomness depends on implementation. We inject `_coin_flip_results` to bypass randomness; if the implementation doesn't honor this hook, those tests will fail for the right reason (coin-flip is not deterministic).\n- **−7 loyalty cost**: The −7 ability and the `test_fourth_ability_cost_minus_seven` test cover it at the declaration level. Testing the full −7 activation against a loyalty total of 7+ would be redundant given the loyalty tracking tests already validate cost arithmetic.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5930,"cache_read_input_tokens":66173,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5930,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01863j2wBNqM4G15CCufN2JX","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"1313f794-e9ca-409c-aa57-a84332bf771c","request_id":"req_011CbU2pK4DfSRwx45UFx7oL","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_97"}
