{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018whXJY5mgdquQEsd2BfRLe","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Run Decisions\n2\t\n3\tDecisions made during this run only. Before the run ends, migrate anything worth preserving into `KEY_DECISIONS.md`.\n4\t\n5\t## Disagreement arbitration: sos_1 (comment index 1)\n6\t- **Issue**: Reviewer wanted unconditional choose_yes_no/choose_card for \"may\" and target selection.\n7\t- **Implementer**: Calls are present but wrapped in try/except fallback because tests use DeterministicPlayer with empty script queue — unconditional calls would raise ScriptExhaustedError.\n8\t- **Decision**: Side with Implementer. The try/except approach is a reasonable compromise. The player-choice calls are present for real game contexts; fallback to auto-yes/first-target is acceptable when no script is provided. Tests define the contract.\n9\t\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"37e48cdb-cca5-43cf-8c9f-afe7247d75b9","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:42:23.389Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/RUN_DECISIONS.md","content":"# Run Decisions\n\nDecisions made during this run only. Before the run ends, migrate anything worth preserving into `KEY_DECISIONS.md`.\n\n## Disagreement arbitration: sos_1 (comment index 1)\n- **Issue**: Reviewer wanted unconditional choose_yes_no/choose_card for \"may\" and target selection.\n- **Implementer**: Calls are present but wrapped in try/except fallback because tests use DeterministicPlayer with empty script queue — unconditional calls would raise ScriptExhaustedError.\n- **Decision**: Side with Implementer. The try/except approach is a reasonable compromise. The player-choice calls are present for real game contexts; fallback to auto-yes/first-target is acceptable when no script is provided. Tests define the contract.\n\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}}}
