lZarekGuestLecturer revised: -2 validates target is in controller's graveyard only; -7 derives controller_index from target_opponent (1 - opponent_index)\"\n83\t        }\n84\t      ]\n85\t    }\n86\t  ]\n87\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LW1BNc6CoXS78pX9RyGxVm","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"99735203-dd3a-41c8-ae1e-aad7eb5fc893","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:50:37.495Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_120"}
