son\n\nSummary of changes made:\n\n**Strict Comment 0 (phase filter)**: Added `phase: Any = None` to `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` in `engine/events.py`. Updated `engine/turn.py` to pass `phase=game.phase` when firing the event. Updated the Paradigm trigger condition to require `event.phase == Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN` (with a `None` guard for backwards compatibility with legacy callers).\n\n**Strict Comment 1 (self-exile)**: Used an additive-only `exile_on_resolve: bool = True` attribute on `ImprovisationCapstone`. Modified `_resolve_spell` in `engine/casting.py` with an `elif getattr(card, \"exile_on_resolve\", False)` branch that routes the card to `Zone.EXILE` instead of `Zone.GRAVEYARD`. Fixed `_paradigm_resolve` to detect when the card is in `Zone.STACK` (real cast path) and skip the manual exile — letting `exile_on_resolve` handle the STACK→EXILE move after `on_resolve` returns.\n\n**Advisory Comment 2**: Moved `self.paradigm_resolved = True` to after the `controller is None` guard.\n\n**Advisory Comment 3**: Removed unused `CardType` import, added needed `Phase` import."}],"totalDurationMs":264063,"totalTokens":67434,"totalToolUseCount":46,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":867,"cache_read_input_tokens":66191,"output_tokens":375,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":867},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":375,"cache_read_input_tokens":66191,"cache_creation_input_tokens":867,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":867,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":18,"searchCount":5,"bashCount":11,"editFileCount":12,"linesAdded":294,"linesRemoved":52,"otherToolCount":0}}}
