{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01EgovY6CPvuEshXuusCMZxg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UopuYzFKJnECcJvPRZYJmR","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC","new_string":"## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent.phase attribute\nAdded in sos_120 revision. The event now carries `phase: Phase` so triggers can filter on PRECOMBAT_MAIN vs POSTCOMBAT_MAIN. When checking, guard with `event.phase is not None` for backward compatibility with old callers.\n\n## exile_on_resolve attribute on cards (engine/casting.py)\nCards that should go to exile instead of graveyard on resolution can set `self.exile_on_resolve = True` in __init__. The `_resolve_spell` function in engine/casting.py checks `getattr(card, \"exile_on_resolve\", False)` and routes to Zone.EXILE instead of Zone.GRAVEYARD.\n\n## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":57331,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"4e3c3feb-1407-4740-85d7-9a79477ddcce","request_id":"req_011CbU4SjoruL8nuUaRzfurP"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UopuYzFKJnECcJvPRZYJmR","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"1021718d-fd16-41e4-9c9f-2f5217ef55f0","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:58:57.785Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC","newString":"## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent.phase attribute\nAdded in sos_120 revision. The event now carries `phase: Phase` so triggers can filter on PRECOMBAT_MAIN vs POSTCOMBAT_MAIN. When checking, guard with `event.phase is not None` for backward compatibility with old callers.\n\n## exile_on_resolve attribute on cards (engine/casting.py)\nCards that should go to exile instead of graveyard on resolution can set `self.exile_on_resolve = True` in __init__. The `_resolve_spell` function in engine/casting.py checks `getattr(card, \"exile_on_resolve\", False)` and routes to Zone.EXILE instead of Zone.GRAVEYARD.\n\n## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC","originalFile":"# Key Decisions\n\nPersistent decisions and conventions across runs.\n\n## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (engine/events.py, engine/turn.py)\nAdded as part of sos_57. This event fires at the start of BOTH PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases. Triggers that use it filter on `event.player` to match the correct player. One-shot triggers deregister on first fire, so they respond to whichever comes next.\n\n## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC\nWhen computing \"amount of mana spent to cast a spell\", prefer `getattr(target, \"mana_spent\", None)` over `mana_cost.cmc` — CMC treats X as 0, which is incorrect for X-cost spells. The `mana_spent` attribute on StackObject is a forward-compatible addition.\n\n## try/except fallback for choose_yes_no / choose_card in triggers\nWhen an ability calls player choice methods (choose_yes_no, choose_card) inside a trigger effect, wrap in try/except with sensible fallbacks (auto-yes, first-valid-target) to avoid ScriptExhaustedError in test contexts with DeterministicPlayer. The choice calls MUST still be present for real game contexts.\n\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":5,"oldLines":6,"newStart":5,"newLines":12,"lines":[" ## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (engine/events.py, engine/turn.py)"," Added as part of sos_57. This event fires at the start of BOTH PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases. Triggers that use it filter on `event.player` to match the correct player. One-shot triggers deregister on first fire, so they respond to whichever comes next."," ","+## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent.phase attribute","+Added in sos_120 revision. The event now carries `phase: Phase` so triggers can filter on PRECOMBAT_MAIN vs POSTCOMBAT_MAIN. When checking, guard with `event.phase is not None` for backward compatibility with old callers.","+","+## exile_on_resolve attribute on cards (engine/casting.py)","+Cards that should go to exile instead of graveyard on resolution can set `self.exile_on_resolve = True` in __init__. The `_resolve_spell` function in engine/casting.py checks `getattr(card, \"exile_on_resolve\", False)` and routes to Zone.EXILE instead of Zone.GRAVEYARD.","+"," ## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC"," When computing \"amount of mana spent to cast a spell\", prefer `getattr(target, \"mana_spent\", None)` over `mana_cost.cmc` — CMC treats X as 0, which is incorrect for X-cost spells. The `mana_spent` attribute on StackObject is a forward-compatible addition."," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
