{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VT1P7sSMizaA4oebqpWLmw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Key Decisions\n2\t\n3\tPersistent decisions and conventions across runs.\n4\t\n5\t## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (engine/events.py, engine/turn.py)\n6\tAdded as part of sos_57. This event fires at the start of BOTH PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases. Triggers that use it filter on `event.player` to match the correct player. One-shot triggers deregister on first fire, so they respond to whichever comes next.\n7\t\n8\t## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent.phase attribute\n9\tAdded in sos_120 revision. The event now carries `phase: Phase` so triggers can filter on PRECOMBAT_MAIN vs POSTCOMBAT_MAIN. When checking, guard with `event.phase is not None` for backward compatibility with old callers.\n10\t\n11\t## exile_on_resolve attribute on cards (engine/casting.py)\n12\tCards that should go to exile instead of graveyard on resolution can set `self.exile_on_resolve = True` in __init__. The `_resolve_spell` function in engine/casting.py checks `getattr(card, \"exile_on_resolve\", False)` and routes to Zone.EXILE instead of Zone.GRAVEYARD.\n13\t\n14\t## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC\n15\tWhen computing \"amount of mana spent to cast a spell\", prefer `getattr(target, \"mana_spent\", None)` over `mana_cost.cmc` — CMC treats X as 0, which is incorrect for X-cost spells. The `mana_spent` attribute on StackObject is a forward-compatible addition.\n16\t\n17\t## try/except fallback for choose_yes_no / choose_card in triggers\n18\tWhen an ability calls player choice methods (choose_yes_no, choose_card) inside a trigger effect, wrap in try/except with sensible fallbacks (auto-yes, first-valid-target) to avoid ScriptExhaustedError in test contexts with DeterministicPlayer. The choice calls MUST still be present for real game contexts.\n19\t\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DescKLr458SyfoTkUSzTT3","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"36e6666f-a605-47ff-831e-ed458271653f","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:03:37.102Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_201"}
