{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014sh4huv2ksKDrnzcwouSkH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives for sos_201\n2\t\n3\t## Untestable item: Miracle mechanic\n4\tThe full miracle mechanic (draw-triggered alternate-cost cast) is out of scope for the engine as-is.\n5\t\n6\tAccept partial coverage:\n7\t- The implementation should set `miracle_cost` attribute on instant/sorcery cards in the controller's hand\n8\t- Add `# UNVERIFIED: miracle cast interaction — full draw-trigger-and-cast requires engine miracle support` comment\n9\t- Document the limitation clearly\n10\t\n11\tThe 22 tests cover all other aspects of the card (static properties, keywords, upkeep trigger, loot effect, miracle cost attribute).\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DescKLr458SyfoTkUSzTT3","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"631d2958-7a43-404f-b2ac-a0179a4f8622","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:03:37.642Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_201"}
