{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01QKcLd3AbifznfoLfsELmpR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01N1XB8hySp6sAZvWFyejhD9","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_201 — Lorehold, the Historian\n\n## Card Overview\n\nLorehold, the Historian is a {3}{R}{W} Legendary Creature — Elder Dragon (5/5) with Flying and Haste that:\n1. Grants each instant and sorcery in the controller's hand miracle {2}.\n2. At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, optionally lets the controller discard a card; if they do, they draw a card.\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### 1. Static Properties\nStandard `Creature` subclass with `Supertype.LEGENDARY`, subtypes `{\"Elder\", \"Dragon\"}`, and `Keyword.FLYING | Keyword.HASTE`. These match the card spec exactly.\n\n### 2. Upkeep Trigger (Opponent's Upkeep)\nRegistered as a `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` trigger with a condition that checks `game.active_player is not controller`. This correctly fires on opponents' upkeeps but not on the controller's own upkeep.\n\nThe effect:\n- Calls `controller.choose_yes_no(...)` with a try/except fallback (per KEY_DECISIONS convention) to avoid `ScriptExhaustedError` in tests.\n- If yes: calls `controller.choose_card(...)` to pick a card from hand, calls `engine.game.discard()`, then `engine.game.draw_card()`.\n- If no (or empty hand): returns without effect.\n\n### 3. Miracle Granting (Static Effect)\nThe miracle mechanic (granting instant/sorcery cards in hand `miracle_cost = ManaCost.parse(\"{2}\")`) presented a challenge because:\n- It's a static/continuous effect that should apply to all instants/sorceries in hand at any time.\n- Tests add cards to the hand via `hand.add()` directly (not via draw) and immediately check for `miracle_cost`.\n- No engine event fires for direct zone-container adds.\n\n**Solution**: In `register_triggers`, we:\n1. Tag all existing instants/sorceries in the hand immediately.\n2. Monkey-patch the hand's `add()` method with a wrapper that tags new instants/sorceries as they enter the hand.\n\nThe original `add` reference and the patched zone are stored on the card instance (`_original_hand_add`, `_hooked_hand_zone`) to enable cleanup. A guard prevents double-patching.\n\n**Limitation**: The miracle cast interaction (draw-triggered alternate-cost cast) is not implemented, as per coordinator directives — full miracle support requires engine-level draw-trigger mechanics that are out of scope.\n```\n# UNVERIFIED: miracle cast interaction — full draw-trigger-and-cast requires engine miracle support\n```\n\n### 4. No Engine Modifications\nThis implementation requires no engine changes. All logic is self-contained in `card_impl.py`.\n\n## Conventions Established\n- Pattern for \"static hand effect\" granting: monkey-patch `zone_container.add` within `register_triggers`. Cleanup via stored originals on the card instance.\n- Coordinator-directed miracle partial coverage: set `miracle_cost` attribute; skip draw-trigger-and-cast mechanic.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":139,"cache_read_input_tokens":54583,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":139,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DescKLr458SyfoTkUSzTT3","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"1fbecaa8-664d-4fa9-ba4a-09bc85b33a18","request_id":"req_011CbU51TNZt2zbfVvybnCJk","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_201"}
