{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013dVwjJJFFKxw8YAEtfK3Xy","type":"tool_result","content":"/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json-116-        {\nFILES_MODIFIED.json-117-          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py\",\nFILES_MODIFIED.json:118:          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_201 Lorehold, the Historian — static properties, keywords, upkeep loot trigger (opponent only), miracle {2} grant to instants/sorceries in hand\"\n/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json-119-        }\n/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json-120-      ],\n--\n/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json-122-        {\nFILES_MODIFIED.json-123-          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py\",\nFILES_MODIFIED.json:124:          \"summary\": \"LoreholdTheHistorian Creature with Flying+Haste, opponent upkeep loot trigger, and hand-zone add hook to grant miracle_cost={2} to instants/sorceries\"\n/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json-125-        }\n/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json-126-      ]\n--\n/workspace/RULEBOOK.txt-4670-702.94a Miracle is a static ability linked to a triggered ability. (See rule 603.11.) “Miracle [cost]” means “You may reveal this card from your hand as you draw it if it’s the first card you’ve drawn this turn. When you reveal this card this way, you may cast it by paying [cost] rather than its mana cost.”\n/workspace/RULEBOOK.txt-4671-\nRULEBOOK.txt:4672:702.94b If a player chooses to reveal a card using its miracle ability, they play with that card revealed until that card leaves their hand, that ability resolves, or that ability otherwise leaves the stack. (See rule 701.20a.)\n/workspace/RULEBOOK.txt-4673-\n/workspace/RULEBOOK.txt-4674-702.95. Soulbond\n--\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-4-\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-5-Flying, haste\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py:6:Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py:7:(You may cast a card for its miracle cost when you draw it if it's the\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-8-first card you drew this turn.)\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-9-At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card.\n--\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-39-\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-40-    Flying, haste\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py:41:    Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-42-    At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card.\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-43-    If you do, draw a card.\n--\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-58-            \"rules_text\",\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-59-            \"Flying, haste\\n\"\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py:60:            \"Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\\n\"\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-61-            \"At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card. \"\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-62-            \"If you do, draw a card.\",\n--\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-71-    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-72-\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py:73:    def _apply_miracle_hook(self, game: \"GameState\") -> None:\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-74-        \"\"\"Install a hook on the controller's HAND zone that tags instants and\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py:75:        sorceries with miracle_cost = {2} when they enter the zone.\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-76-\n/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-77-        Also immediately tags all existing instants/sorceries in the hand.\n--\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-85-        for card in hand.get_all():\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py-86-            if _is_instant_or_sorcery(card):\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py:87:                card.miracle_cost = _MIRACLE_COST\n/workspace/