{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011QrbtfKZaSfTF7Pqzzt8At","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ez6JEYDra9qBe1vEkX8WrZ","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# Revision Rationale — sos_201 Lorehold, the Historian\n\n## Strict Comment 1 (line 109): Wire up _remove_miracle_hook() via LeavesBattlefieldTriggeredEvent\n\n**Problem**: `_remove_miracle_hook()` was defined but never called. The engine's `unregister(card)` path only removes triggers/replacements — it does not call any custom cleanup on the card. This meant the monkey-patch on `hand.add` persisted indefinitely after Lorehold left the battlefield, causing instants/sorceries added to the controller's hand afterward to receive `miracle_cost = {2}` incorrectly.\n\n**Fix**: Added a second `TriggerRegistration` in `register_triggers()` for `LeavesBattlefieldTriggeredEvent`. Its condition checks `event.permanent is source` (identity match on Lorehold), and its effect calls `source._remove_miracle_hook()`. This restores `hand.add` to the original implementation when Lorehold leaves.\n\nThis mirrors the pattern used by `BanishingLight` (`cards/fdn/fdn_138/card_impl.py`) for `LeavesBattlefieldTriggeredEvent` cleanup.\n\n## Strict Comment 2 (line 98): Add battlefield-presence check inside _patched_add\n\n**Problem**: The `_patched_add` closure had the comment \"If Lorehold is still on the battlefield\" but performed no actual check. The variable `source = self` was captured but never referenced inside the closure, making it dead code.\n\n**Fix**: Added `if source._hooked_hand_zone is not None` as the guard. When `_remove_miracle_hook()` fires (Lorehold leaves), it sets `self._hooked_hand_zone = None`. The closure now checks this sentinel — if it's `None`, Lorehold has already left and no `miracle_cost` is granted. This leverages the already-captured `source` reference to implement the battlefield-presence check without needing a separate zone lookup.\n\n## Advisory Comment (line 94)\n\nThe `source = self` capture was already present and is now actually used inside `_patched_add` for the battlefield-presence check, so it is no longer dead code.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll 22 tests in `cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` pass. The full suite of 1372 tests continues to pass.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2593,"cache_read_input_tokens":35901,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2593,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014vrAXhQS8vhtbdg2wsB5zm","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"5408fcda-d037-40ff-b11c-7f90084bc8fb","request_id":"req_011CbU5JyYFmE3Az47EgkNkZ","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revision round for sos_201"}
