uill the Disputant \\u2014 static properties, trigger registration, casualty condition (instant/sorcery only, controller-only), casualty effect (sacrifice + copy), power >= 1 requirement, battlefield presence\"\n81\t        }\n82\t      ],\n83\t      \"implementation\": [\n84\t        {\n85\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py\",\n86\t          \"summary\": \"SilverquillTheDisputant Creature with Flying/Vigilance/Legendary/Elder Dragon; SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger for casualty 1 \\u2014 choose_yes_no sacrifice, power>=1 validation, copy_spell push, _last_copy attribute\"\n87\t        }\n88\t      ]\n89\t    },\n90\t    {\n91\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n92\t      \"tests\": [\n93\t        {\n94\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n95\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_4 Together as One \\u2014 static properties, converge attribute, zero-color no-op, draw/damage/life-gain effects scaling with colors_spent, targeting API\"\n96\t        }\n97\t      ],\n98\t      \"implementation\": [\n99\t        {\n100\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n101\t          \"summary\": \"TogetherAsOne Sorcery with colors_spent converge attribute, get_targets returning two requirements, on_resolve applying draw/damage/life-gain for X = colors_spent\"\n102\t        }\n103\t      ]\n104\t    },\n105\t    {\n106\t      \"card\": \"sos_57\",\n107\t      \"tests\": [\n108\t        {\n109\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py\",\n110\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_57 Mana Sculpt \\u2014 static properties, targeting API, counterspell mechanics, Wizard check, BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent one-shot mana scheduling\"\n111\t        }\n112\t      ],\n113\t      \"implementation\": [\n114\t        {\n115\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\",\n116\t          \"summary\": \"ManaSculpt Instant \\u2014 counters target spell, schedules colorless mana (mana_spent if available, else CMC) at next main phase (pre- or postcombat) if controller has a Wizard\"\n117\t        },\n118\t        {\n119\t          \"path\": \"engine/events.py\",\n120\t          \"summary\": \"Added BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent with player attribute\"\n121\t        },\n122\t        {\n123\t          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n124\t          \"summary\": \"Fire BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent at both PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phase starts\"\n125\t        }\n126\t      ]\n127\t    },\n128\t    {\n129\t      \"card\": \"sos_97\",\n130\t      \"tests\": [\n131\t        {\n132\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py\",\n133\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_97 Ral Zarek Guest Lecturer \\u2014 static properties, loyalty abilities, surveil 2, discard any players, return creature from controller's graveyard only, coin-flip turn-skip ultimate using target_opponent\"\n134\t        }\n135\t      ],\n136\t      \"implementation\": [\n137\t        {\n138\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py\",\n139\t          \"summary\": \"RalZarekGuestLecturer revised: -2 validates target is in controller's graveyard only; -7 derives controller_index from target_opponent (1 - opponent_index)\"\n140\t        }\n141\t      ]\n142\t    }\n143\t  ]\n144\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018LRkPu3v1xUbdH5FNBbAr1","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"9b233068-97d0-4bfe-9aea-b4fd1f1f759b","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:29:02.628Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_245"}
