{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_012yJ6JswEtuWXmQ9dfc2tXb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014mSfVGPcdYXE1238drWQvj","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"## try/except fallback for choose_yes_no / choose_card in triggers\nWhen an ability calls player choice methods (choose_yes_no, choose_card) inside a trigger effect, wrap in try/except with sensible fallbacks (auto-yes, first-valid-target) to avoid ScriptExhaustedError in test contexts with DeterministicPlayer. The choice calls MUST still be present for real game contexts.","new_string":"## try/except fallback for choose_yes_no / choose_card in triggers\nWhen an ability calls player choice methods (choose_yes_no, choose_card) inside a trigger effect, wrap in try/except with sensible fallbacks (auto-yes, first-valid-target) to avoid ScriptExhaustedError in test contexts with DeterministicPlayer. The choice calls MUST still be present for real game contexts.\n\n## game.active_cost_reducers — permanent-granted spell cost reduction (engine/game_state.py, engine/casting.py)\nAdded as part of sos_245 (Witherbloom, the Balancer). GameState now has an `active_cost_reducers: list[dict]` attribute. Each entry is a dict with:\n  - `\"source\"`: the permanent granting the reduction\n  - `\"condition\"`: callable(card) -> bool — True if this reducer applies to the spell being cast\n  - `\"reduction\"`: callable(game, controller) -> int — the amount to reduce generic mana by\n`get_cost_reduction` in engine/casting.py aggregates reductions from this list on top of the card's own `cost_reduction()` method. Cards that grant cost reductions to OTHER spells (not self) should add an entry to `game.active_cost_reducers` in their `register_triggers` method. Unlike triggers, these entries are NOT automatically removed by `trigger_manager.unregister`; cards must manage their own lifecycle if cleanup is needed."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":546,"cache_read_input_tokens":68335,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":546,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018LRkPu3v1xUbdH5FNBbAr1","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"e0d910bd-154e-4e9d-b9c8-8f22170bbb56","request_id":"req_011CbU6ta8QaHJigadDTrPqq","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_245"}
