{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DhgizisJYbuCkeFcoJc3Ns","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"cards\": [\n3\t    {\n4\t      \"card\": \"sos_1\",\n5\t      \"tests\": [\n6\t        {\n7\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py\",\n8\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_1 The Dawning Archaic \\u2014 static properties, cost reduction, attack trigger registration, free-cast from graveyard, exile replacement\"\n9\t        }\n10\t      ],\n11\t      \"implementation\": [\n12\t        {\n13\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py\",\n14\t          \"summary\": \"TheDawningArchaic revised to use cast_spell_free pipeline, on_resolve wrapper for exile-instead, choose_yes_no/choose_card with fallback for test compatibility\"\n15\t        }\n16\t      ]\n17\t    },\n18\t    {\n19\t      \"card\": \"sos_120\",\n20\t      \"tests\": [\n21\t        {\n22\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py\",\n23\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_120 Improvisation Capstone \\u2014 static properties, library exile until MV>=4, free-cast from exile, Paradigm self-exile, paradigm_resolved flag, recurring PRECOMBAT_MAIN trigger registration and firing\"\n24\t        }\n25\t      ],\n26\t      \"implementation\": [\n27\t        {\n28\t          \"path\": \"engine/events.py\",\n29\t          \"summary\": \"Added phase attribute to BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent for PRECOMBAT_MAIN vs POSTCOMBAT_MAIN disambiguation\"\n30\t        },\n31\t        {\n32\t          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n33\t          \"summary\": \"Pass phase=game.phase when firing BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent at each main phase\"\n34\t        },\n35\t        {\n36\t          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n37\t          \"summary\": \"Added exile_on_resolve branch in _resolve_spell so Paradigm spells route to exile instead of graveyard\"\n38\t        },\n39\t        {\n40\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_120/card_impl.py\",\n41\t          \"summary\": \"ImprovisationCapstone: exile_on_resolve=True, PRECOMBAT_MAIN phase filter on Paradigm trigger, fixed _paradigm_resolve zone detection, fixed paradigm_resolved ordering, removed dead CardType import\"\n42\t        }\n43\t      ]\n44\t    },\n45\t    {\n46\t      \"card\": \"sos_13\",\n47\t      \"tests\": [\n48\t        {\n49\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\",\n50\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares \\u2014 static properties, prepared attribute, ETB trigger registration, Inkling token creation, prepared condition checks, cast_prepared_spell API, targeting API\"\n51\t        }\n52\t      ],\n53\t      \"implementation\": [\n54\t        {\n55\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\",\n56\t          \"summary\": \"Fixed cast_prepared_spell to find target before unpreparing \\u2014 creature stays prepared if no legal target exists on battlefield\"\n57\t        }\n58\t      ]\n59\t    },\n60\t    {\n61\t      \"card\": \"sos_201\",\n62\t      \"tests\": [\n63\t        {\n64\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py\",\n65\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_201 Lorehold, the Historian \\u2014 static properties, keywords, upkeep loot trigger (opponent only), miracle {2} grant to instants/sorceries in hand\"\n66\t        }\n67\t      ],\n68\t      \"implementation\": [\n69\t        {\n70\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py\",\n71\t          \"summary\": \"Added LeavesBattlefieldTriggeredEvent trigger to call _remove_miracle_hook on departure; added source._hooked_hand_zone is not None guard inside _patched_add closure for battlefield-presence check\"\n72\t        }\n73\t      ]\n74\t    },\n75\t    {\n76\t      \"card\": \"sos_226\",\n77\t      \"tests\": [\n78\t        {\n79\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py\",\n80\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_226 Silverquill the Disputant \\u2014 static properties, trigger registration, casualty condition (instant/sorcery only, controller-only), casualty effect (sacrifice + copy), power >= 1 requirement, battlefield presence\"\n81\t        }\n82\t      ],\n83\t      \"implementation\": [\n84\t        {\n85\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py\",\n86\t          \"summary\": \"SilverquillTheDisputant Creature with Flying/Vigilance/Legendary/Elder Dragon; SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger for casualty 1 \\u2014 choose_yes_no sacrifice, power>=1 validation, copy_spell push, _last_copy attribute\"\n87\t        }\n88\t      ]\n89\t    },\n90\t    {\n91\t      \"card\": \"sos_245\",\n92\t      \"tests\": [\n93\t        {\n94\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py\",\n95\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_245 Witherbloom the Balancer \\u2014 static properties, self-affinity cost reduction (capped at 6), SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger registration/condition/effect, and integration tests for instant/sorcery cost reduction via active_cost_reducers\"\n96\t        }\n97\t      ],\n98\t      \"implementation\": [\n99\t        {\n100\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py\",\n101\t          \"summary\": \"WitherbloomTheBalancer: Flying/Deathtouch/Legendary/Elder Dragon 5/5; self-affinity cost_reduction counting controller creatures capped at 6; register_triggers adds SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger and active_cost_reducers entry for instant/sorcery affinity grant\"\n102\t        },\n103\t        {\n104\t          \"path\": \"engine/game_state.py\",\n105\t          \"summary\": \"Added active_cost_reducers list to GameState for permanent-based spell cost reduction\"\n106\t        },\n107\t        {\n108\t          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n109\t          \"summary\": \"Modified get_cost_reduction to aggregate reductions from game.active_cost_reducers in addition to card.cost_reduction\"\n110\t        }\n111\t      ]\n112\t    },\n113\t    {\n114\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n115\t      \"tests\": [\n116\t        {\n117\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n118\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_4 Together as One \\u2014 static properties, converge attribute, zero-color no-op, draw/damage/life-gain effects scaling with colors_spent, targeting API\"\n119\t        }\n120\t      ],\n121\t      \"implementation\": [\n122\t        {\n123\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n124\t          \"summary\": \"TogetherAsOne Sorcery with colors_spent converge attribute, get_targets returning two requirements, on_resolve applying draw/damage/life-gain for X = colors_spent\"\n125\t        }\n126\t      ]\n127\t    },\n128\t    {\n129\t      \"card\": \"sos_57\",\n130\t      \"tests\": [\n131\t        {\n132\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py\",\n133\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_57 Mana Sculpt \\u2014 static properties, targeting API, counterspell mechanics, Wizard check, BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent one-shot mana scheduling\"\n134\t        }\n135\t      ],\n136\t      \"implementation\": [\n137\t        {\n138\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\",\n139\t          \"summary\": \"ManaSculpt Instant \\u2014 counters target spell, schedules colorless mana (mana_spent if available, else CMC) at next main phase (pre- or postcombat) if controller has a Wizard\"\n140\t        },\n141\t        {\n142\t          \"path\": \"engine/events.py\",\n143\t          \"summary\": \"Added BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent with player attribute\"\n144\t        },\n145\t        {\n146\t          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n147\t          \"summary\": \"Fire BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent at both PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phase starts\"\n148\t        }\n149\t      ]\n150\t    },\n151\t    {\n152\t      \"card\": \"sos_97\",\n153\t      \"tests\": [\n154\t        {\n155\t          \"path\": \"/workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py\",\n156\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_97 Ral Zarek Guest Lecturer \\u2014 static properties, loyalty abilities, surveil 2, discard any players, return creature from controller's graveyard only, coin-flip turn-skip ultimate using target_opponent\"\n157\t        }\n158\t      ],\n159\t      \"implementation\": [\n160\t        {\n161\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py\",\n162\t          \"summary\": \"RalZarekGuestLecturer revised: -2 validates target is in controller's graveyard only; -7 derives controller_index from target_opponent (1 - opponent_index)\"\n163\t        }\n164\t      ]\n165\t    }\n166\t  ]\n167\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012s7dMnBNeeuBuVB5j2ytoq","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"f40dfff7-6b3d-4b59-97c1-2ae4404d2d01","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:31:35.327Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Reviewer for sos_245"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BVy86R1wNBa5hCADVDyeqb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Key Decisions\n2\t\n3\tPersistent decisions and conventions across runs.\n4\t\n5\t## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (engine/events.py, engine/turn.py)\n6\tAdded as part of sos_57. This event fires at the start of BOTH PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases. Triggers that use it filter on `event.player` to match the correct player. One-shot triggers deregister on first fire, so they respond to whichever comes next.\n7\t\n8\t## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent.phase attribute\n9\tAdded in sos_120 revision. The event now carries `phase: Phase` so triggers can filter on PRECOMBAT_MAIN vs POSTCOMBAT_MAIN. When checking, guard with `event.phase is not None` for backward compatibility with old callers.\n10\t\n11\t## exile_on_resolve attribute on cards (engine/casting.py)\n12\tCards that should go to exile instead of graveyard on resolution can set `self.exile_on_resolve = True` in __init__. The `_resolve_spell` function in engine/casting.py checks `getattr(card, \"exile_on_resolve\", False)` and routes to Zone.EXILE instead of Zone.GRAVEYARD.\n13\t\n14\t## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC\n15\tWhen computing \"amount of mana spent to cast a spell\", prefer `getattr(target, \"mana_spent\", None)` over `mana_cost.cmc` — CMC treats X as 0, which is incorrect for X-cost spells. The `mana_spent` attribute on StackObject is a forward-compatible addition.\n16\t\n17\t## try/except fallback for choose_yes_no / choose_card in triggers\n18\tWhen an ability calls player choice methods (choose_yes_no, choose_card) inside a trigger effect, wrap in try/except with sensible fallbacks (auto-yes, first-valid-target) to avoid ScriptExhaustedError in test contexts with DeterministicPlayer. The choice calls MUST still be present for real game contexts.\n19\t\n20\t## game.active_cost_reducers — permanent-granted spell cost reduction (engine/game_state.py, engine/casting.py)\n21\tAdded as part of sos_245 (Witherbloom, the Balancer). GameState now has an `active_cost_reducers: list[dict]` attribute. Each entry is a dict with:\n22\t  - `\"source\"`: the permanent granting the reduction\n23\t  - `\"condition\"`: callable(card) -> bool — True if this reducer applies to the spell being cast\n24\t  - `\"reduction\"`: callable(game, controller) -> int — the amount to reduce generic mana by\n25\t`get_cost_reduction` in engine/casting.py aggregates reductions from this list on top of the card's own `cost_reduction()` method. Cards that grant cost reductions to OTHER spells (not self) should add an entry to `game.active_cost_reducers` in their `register_triggers` method. Unlike triggers, these entries are NOT automatically removed by `trigger_manager.unregister`; cards must manage their own lifecycle if cleanup is needed.\n26\t\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012s7dMnBNeeuBuVB5j2ytoq","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"ab333115-c200-4998-8461-32851db81a66","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:31:35.328Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Reviewer for sos_245"}
