{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XoP7kAe1B12ytojgeefqCe","type":"tool_result","content":"FILES_MODIFIED.json:95:          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_245 Witherbloom the Balancer \\u2014 static properties, self-affinity cost reduction (capped at 6), SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger registration/condition/effect, and integration tests for instant/sorcery cost reduction via active_cost_reducers\"\nFILES_MODIFIED.json:101:          \"summary\": \"WitherbloomTheBalancer: Flying/Deathtouch/Legendary/Elder Dragon 5/5; self-affinity cost_reduction counting controller creatures capped at 6; register_triggers adds SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger and active_cost_reducers entry for instant/sorcery affinity grant\"\nFILES_MODIFIED.json:105:          \"summary\": \"Added active_cost_reducers list to GameState for permanent-based spell cost reduction\"\nFILES_MODIFIED.json:109:          \"summary\": \"Modified get_cost_reduction to aggregate reductions from game.active_cost_reducers in addition to card.cost_reduction\"\nengine/game_state.py:89:        self.active_cost_reducers: list[dict] = []\nKEY_DECISIONS.md:20:## game.active_cost_reducers — permanent-granted spell cost reduction (engine/game_state.py, engine/casting.py)\nKEY_DECISIONS.md:21:Added as part of sos_245 (Witherbloom, the Balancer). GameState now has an `active_cost_reducers: list[dict]` attribute. Each entry is a dict with:\nKEY_DECISIONS.md:25:`get_cost_reduction` in engine/casting.py aggregates reductions from this list on top of the card's own `cost_reduction()` method. Cards that grant cost reductions to OTHER spells (not self) should add an entry to `game.active_cost_reducers` in their `register_triggers` method. Unlike triggers, these entries are NOT automatically removed by `trigger_manager.unregister`; cards must manage their own lifecycle if cleanup is needed.\nengine/casting.py:95:    Also consults ``game.active_cost_reducers`` — a list of reducer dicts\nengine/casting.py:110:    # Consult active_cost_reducers from permanents on the battlefield.\nengine/casting.py:111:    active_reducers = getattr(game, \"active_cost_reducers\", [])\ncards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py:50:        # Reference to the cost reducer entry we register in active_cost_reducers,\ncards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py:86:        2. Adds an entry to game.active_cost_reducers so that the\ncards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py:115:            \"\"\"No-op effect — cost reduction is handled via active_cost_reducers.\"\"\"\ncards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py:116:            # The affinity reduction is applied at cast time via active_cost_reducers.\ncards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py:134:        # --- active_cost_reducers entry for casting pipeline ---\ncards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py:164:        game.active_cost_reducers.append(reducer_entry)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012s7dMnBNeeuBuVB5j2ytoq","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"c1465a51-2e99-4fda-aa8a-6e24bd5ca511","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:32:01.863Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Reviewer for sos_245"}
