{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Gjc6LxgLMPiMWU3DM4v1RN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WyHCEdX6o7xN29qBfJymFN","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — SOS 257: Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\n## Card Summary\n\nGreat Hall of the Biblioplex is a Land with three abilities:\n1. `{T}: Add {C}.` — basic colorless mana tap ability\n2. `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.` — colored mana at cost of 1 life (restricted)\n3. `{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with \"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\" It's still a land.` — activated animation ability\n\n## Test File\n\n`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`\n\n---\n\n## Class: TestGreatHallProperties\n\n**What is tested:** Static card identity properties.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_is_land` | Card must be an instance of `Land` (type line says \"Land\") |\n| `test_name` | Name must be \"Great Hall of the Biblioplex\" |\n| `test_no_mana_cost` | Lands have no mana cost; CMC should be 0 |\n| `test_card_type_land` | `CardType.LAND` must be in `card_types` |\n| `test_can_cast_returns_false` | Lands are played, not cast; `can_cast` must return False |\n\n---\n\n## Class: TestGreatHallColorlessManaAbility\n\n**What is tested:** `{T}: Add {C}` — first mana ability.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_has_at_least_two_mana_abilities` | Card must expose at least 2 mana abilities via `get_mana_abilities()` |\n| `test_first_ability_adds_colorless_mana` | Paying the cost adds 1 colorless mana to the pool |\n| `test_first_ability_taps_the_land` | After paying the cost, the land is tapped |\n| `test_first_ability_fails_when_already_tapped` | Tap cost cannot be paid if land is already tapped |\n\n---\n\n## Class: TestGreatHallColoredManaAbility\n\n**What is tested:** `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color` — second mana ability.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_second_ability_costs_life` | Activating the second ability pays 1 life from the controller |\n| `test_second_ability_taps_the_land` | Land becomes tapped after paying the second ability's cost |\n| `test_second_ability_adds_colored_mana` | The second ability adds at least 1 colored mana to the pool |\n| `test_second_ability_fails_when_already_tapped` | Tap cost fails if land is already tapped |\n| `test_second_ability_does_not_add_colorless` | The mana produced is colored, not colorless |\n\n**Edge cases not covered:**\n- The restriction \"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" is engine-level enforcement that is not currently testable via the public API (mana pool does not track spending restrictions per mana unit). Recorded in `untestable.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Class: TestGreatHallAnimationAbility\n\n**What is tested:** `{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature-land` — activated ability.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_has_at_least_one_activated_ability` | Card exposes at least one activated ability via `get_activated_abilities()` |\n| `test_animation_ability_requires_five_generic_mana` | Cost of {5} is enforced — 4 mana is insufficient |\n| `test_animation_ability_succeeds_with_five_mana` | Cost of {5} succeeds when exactly 5 generic mana is available |\n| `test_animation_adds_creature_type_to_land` | After effect, card has both LAND and CREATURE in `card_types` |\n| `test_animation_sets_power_to_two` | After effect, the land's power is 2 |\n| `test_animation_sets_toughness_to_four` | After effect, the land's toughness is 4 |\n| `test_animation_adds_wizard_subtype` | After effect, \"Wizard\" appears in `subtypes` |\n| `test_animation_does_nothing_if_already_creature` | \"If this land isn't a creature\" guard — re-activation is a no-op |\n\n---\n\n## Class: TestGreatHallWizardTrigger\n\n**What is tested:** The Wizard creature's triggered ability: `Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn`.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_register_triggers_registers_spell_cast_trigger_after_animation` | After animation+register_triggers, a `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` trigger exists |\n| `test_wizard_trigger_condition_true_for_controller_instant` | Trigger condition is True when controller casts an instant |\n| `test_wizard_trigger_condition_true_for_controller_sorcery` | Trigger condition is True when controller casts a sorcery |\n| `test_wizard_trigger_condition_false_for_opponent_instant` | Trigger condition is False when opponent casts an instant |\n| `test_wizard_trigger_condition_false_for_controller_creature` | Trigger condition is False when controller casts a creature (not instant/sorcery) |\n| `test_wizard_trigger_effect_grants_plus_one_power` | Trigger effect increases `modified_power` by +1 |\n\n---\n\n## Untestable Requirements\n\nSee `untestable.json`:\n1. **\"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\"** — The engine's `ManaPool` does not tag individual mana units with spending restrictions, so the restriction on the second mana ability's output cannot be asserted from tests.\n2. **\"It's still a land\"** — The `CardType.LAND` persistence after animation is tested via `test_animation_adds_creature_type_to_land`, but whether the land *also* continues to produce mana (i.e., the animated creature-land can still tap for mana) is not covered because calling the ability again after animation is left to integration testing.\n3. **Until-end-of-turn cleanup of the +1/+0** — The engine's EOT cleanup mechanism for `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` continuous effects is not directly observable from a unit test at the card level; this is engine behavior.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5984,"cache_read_input_tokens":55639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5984,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QTHZ9RYgmYJYYrHMdM5GwN","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"abb5cc41-96d5-45ff-b502-af887895e003","request_id":"req_011CbU7V181potRBjpKVCPP7","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_257"}
