{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mo14bmkcukVV8Lp8a2t9Qn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives for sos_257\n2\t\n3\t## Untestable item 1: Mana spending restriction\n4\tThe \"spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery\" restriction cannot be enforced in the current engine (no tagged-mana system). Accept partial coverage:\n5\t- Implement the mana ability normally (add one mana of any color)\n6\t- Add `# UNVERIFIED: mana spending restriction — requires tagged-mana engine support` comment\n7\t- The mana-adding behavior is tested; the restriction enforcement is not\n8\t\n9\t## Untestable item 2: End-of-turn +1/+0 cleanup\n10\tThe power boost expiring at end of turn cannot be easily tested in unit tests. Accept partial coverage:\n11\t- Implement the boost as a `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` continuous effect\n12\t- Add `# UNVERIFIED: end-of-turn +1/+0 expiry — requires full turn cycle to test` comment\n13\t- The boost being applied is tested; the expiry is not\n14\t\n15\t## Implementation notes\n16\t- This is a Land card that can also become a creature (animation via {5} activated ability)\n17\t- The colorless mana ability is a tap ability ({T}: Add {C})\n18\t- The colored mana ability costs life ({T}, pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color)\n19\t- The animation ability ({5}: becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature until end of turn)\n20\t- The Wizard trigger: whenever controller casts an instant/sorcery, this gets +1/+0 until end of turn\n21\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01K7g5a7puYta641x73xhYDo","session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"75f0ab73-586f-443a-b528-2a9965d8f26a","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:40:26.224Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_257"}
