{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01G1VhhzqngSqVhM6r3RoYUY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UzjVqxxzM5XACywBCKqZL9","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"## game.active_cost_reducers","new_string":"## EndOfTurnTriggeredEvent now fired in engine/turn.py\nAdded as part of sos_257. The event was already defined in engine/events.py but never fired. Now fires at (Phase.ENDING, Step.END). One-shot triggers that need \"until end of turn\" cleanup should register on EndOfTurnTriggeredEvent using a unique sentinel source object().\n\n## game.active_cost_reducers"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783,"cache_read_input_tokens":80920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783},"output_tokens":28,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"fb9d69c9-3f6e-44bf-85e3-6e1ee139c37b","request_id":"req_011CbU8SpWbrKxQBtoNjDe3B"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UzjVqxxzM5XACywBCKqZL9","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc7916e9-61b8-4183-92a0-8e53a58e330b","uuid":"baca1a7c-7f51-4e72-83a5-3488e8c9b6cf","timestamp":"2026-05-28T01:51:20.696Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"## game.active_cost_reducers","newString":"## EndOfTurnTriggeredEvent now fired in engine/turn.py\nAdded as part of sos_257. The event was already defined in engine/events.py but never fired. Now fires at (Phase.ENDING, Step.END). One-shot triggers that need \"until end of turn\" cleanup should register on EndOfTurnTriggeredEvent using a unique sentinel source object().\n\n## game.active_cost_reducers","originalFile":"# Key Decisions\n\nPersistent decisions and conventions across runs.\n\n## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (engine/events.py, engine/turn.py)\nAdded as part of sos_57. This event fires at the start of BOTH PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases. Triggers that use it filter on `event.player` to match the correct player. One-shot triggers deregister on first fire, so they respond to whichever comes next.\n\n## BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent.phase attribute\nAdded in sos_120 revision. The event now carries `phase: Phase` so triggers can filter on PRECOMBAT_MAIN vs POSTCOMBAT_MAIN. When checking, guard with `event.phase is not None` for backward compatibility with old callers.\n\n## exile_on_resolve attribute on cards (engine/casting.py)\nCards that should go to exile instead of graveyard on resolution can set `self.exile_on_resolve = True` in __init__. The `_resolve_spell` function in engine/casting.py checks `getattr(card, \"exile_on_resolve\", False)` and routes to Zone.EXILE instead of Zone.GRAVEYARD.\n\n## Mana amount for counterspell: use mana_spent over CMC\nWhen computing \"amount of mana spent to cast a spell\", prefer `getattr(target, \"mana_spent\", None)` over `mana_cost.cmc` — CMC treats X as 0, which is incorrect for X-cost spells. The `mana_spent` attribute on StackObject is a forward-compatible addition.\n\n## try/except fallback for choose_yes_no / choose_card in triggers\nWhen an ability calls player choice methods (choose_yes_no, choose_card) inside a trigger effect, wrap in try/except with sensible fallbacks (auto-yes, first-valid-target) to avoid ScriptExhaustedError in test contexts with DeterministicPlayer. The choice calls MUST still be present for real game contexts.\n\n## game.active_cost_reducers — permanent-granted spell cost reduction (engine/game_state.py, engine/casting.py)\nAdded as part of sos_245 (Witherbloom, the Balancer). GameState now has an `active_cost_reducers: list[dict]` attribute. Each entry is a dict with:\n  - `\"source\"`: the permanent granting the reduction\n  - `\"condition\"`: callable(card) -> bool — True if this reducer applies to the spell being cast\n  - `\"reduction\"`: callable(game, controller) -> int — the amount to reduce generic mana by\n`get_cost_reduction` in engine/casting.py aggregates reductions from this list on top of the card's own `cost_reduction()` method. Cards that grant cost reductions to OTHER spells (not self) should add an entry to `game.active_cost_reducers` in their `register_triggers` method. Unlike triggers, these entries are NOT automatically removed by `trigger_manager.unregister`; cards must manage their own lifecycle if cleanup is needed.\n\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":6,"newStart":17,"newLines":9,"lines":[" ## try/except fallback for choose_yes_no / choose_card in triggers"," When an ability calls player choice methods (choose_yes_no, choose_card) inside a trigger effect, wrap in try/except with sensible fallbacks (auto-yes, first-valid-target) to avoid ScriptExhaustedError in test contexts with DeterministicPlayer. The choice calls MUST still be present for real game contexts."," ","+## EndOfTurnTriggeredEvent now fired in engine/turn.py","+Added as part of sos_257. The event was already defined in engine/events.py but never fired. Now fires at (Phase.ENDING, Step.END). One-shot triggers that need \"until end of turn\" cleanup should register on EndOfTurnTriggeredEvent using a unique sentinel source object().","+"," ## game.active_cost_reducers — permanent-granted spell cost reduction (engine/game_state.py, engine/casting.py)"," Added as part of sos_245 (Witherbloom, the Balancer). GameState now has an `active_cost_reducers: list[dict]` attribute. Each entry is a dict with:","   - `\"source\"`: the permanent granting the reduction"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
